{"Title":"Resolutions designating August 12th and 13th, 2023 as the sales tax holiday","BillNumber":"S2403","DocketNumber":"SD2655","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"SLM0","Name":"Susan L. Moran","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SLM0","ResponseDate":"2023-06-13T12:02:34.54"},"Cosponsors":[],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2403/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Resolution","Pinslip":"Senate, June 15, 2023-- Resolutions (filed by Senator Moran) designating August 12th and 13th as the sales tax holiday","DocumentText":"\tWhereas, the general court is charged with annually designating a sales tax holiday weekend in the month of August; therefore be it\r\n\tResolved, that the days of August 12 and 13 shall be the sales tax holiday for the year 2023 pursuant to chapter 64H section 6A of the General Laws.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[],"Amendments":[]}